Package: foflocomotorcapacitycohort
Title: FOF and Locomotor Capacity Cohort
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Tomi", "Korpi", email = "tomi.pt.korpi@helsinki.fi",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0003-0217-8291",
                       affiliation = "University of Helsinki, Faculty of Medicine, Doctoral Programme in Clinical Research (CLINDOC)"))
Description: Public research software and reproducibility materials for a
    12-month cohort study of fear of falling and locomotor capacity in older
    adults. Public validation uses synthetic fixtures and does not reproduce or
    distribute protected participant-level analyses.
